---
export const prerender = false;
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getAllSiteSettings } from '../lib/queries';

const settings = await getAllSiteSettings();
const settingsList = Array.isArray(settings) ? settings : [];
const settingsObj = settingsList.reduce((acc: any, s: any) => { if (s && s.key) acc[s.key] = s.value; return acc; }, {} as Record<string, string>);
const customTerms = settingsObj.terms_custom_text || '';
---

<Layout title="Terms & Conditions - Orandus" description="Terms and conditions for using Orandus.">
  <section class="min-h-screen bg-nitkkr-cream py-12 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-6">
      <div>
        <h1 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-nitkkr-dark">📜 Terms & Conditions</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Last updated: September 2026</p>
      </div>

      {customTerms ? (
        <div class="p-4 bg-amber-50 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line">
          {customTerms}
        </div>
      ) : null}

      <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">1. What Orandus Is</h2>
          <p>Orandus is an independent food discovery directory for campus eateries and food vendors around NIT Kurukshetra. We provide easy access to menus, prices, dishes, vendor locations, and direct contact details.</p>
          <p class="mt-2">Orandus is <strong>not</strong> a restaurant, food delivery company, or payment intermediary. We do not cook, deliver, accept orders on behalf of vendors, or collect customer payments. Orandus does not charge commissions on transactions between users and vendors.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">2. Direct Vendor Orders & WhatsApp Communication</h2>
          <p>When you contact a food spot—whether by tapping their phone number, messaging them on WhatsApp, or visiting their counter in person—you are dealing directly and exclusively with that independent vendor.</p>
          <p class="mt-2">Order placement, item availability, preparation time, pricing confirmation, delivery, payments, cancellations, refunds, and food hygiene are 100% between you and the respective vendor. Orandus is not a party to your transaction and does not process, supervise, or guarantee any orders placed via WhatsApp, phone, or in person.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">3. Menu Information & Pricing</h2>
          <p>We strive to keep menu items, prices, operating hours, and diet tags up to date. However, vendors may adjust their prices, recipes, or availability without immediate notice.</p>
          <p class="mt-2">We encourage students to verify prices directly with the vendor when placing an order or inquiry.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">4. Student Reviews & Community Conduct</h2>
          <p>Student reviews help the campus community find the best food spots. When leaving reviews, please keep feedback honest, helpful, and respectful. Defamatory, abusive, or spammy content will be removed.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">5. External Links (WhatsApp, Maps & Phone Dialer)</h2>
          <p>Orandus provides direct links to third-party services, such as WhatsApp, Google Maps, and your phone dialer, solely for user convenience. When you leave Orandus via these links, the respective third party's terms and privacy policies govern your interaction.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">6. Platform Availability</h2>
          <p>Orandus is provided on an "as-is" and "as-available" basis. While we aim for continuous uptime, we do not warrant that the service will be uninterrupted or error-free.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">7. Updates to Terms</h2>
          <p>We may update these terms as our platform evolves. Continued use of Orandus constitutes acceptance of any updated terms.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">8. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>Questions or suggestions regarding these terms? Reach out through our <a href="/contact" class="text-nitkkr-orange font-bold hover:underline">Contact page</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>